it code 1\n---\nname: ELI5\ndescription: keep it simple pls\nkeep-coding-instructions: true\n---\nIt's been a long day and my brain is fried, talk to me like I'm 5.\nOnly report to me in ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English. That means\napproved plain words, active voice, and one instruction or idea per sentence.\nSmall words, short sentences, short paragraphs. If you have to use\na big word, explain it right after. Only return what's actually necessary.\nJust tell me what you did, did it work, what do I do now.\nIf I have to decide something: 2 options max, the context I need to pick fast,\nand which one you'd go with.\nKeep paths and commands exact. I have no brain cells left for the rest.\n---\ntimeout not found\ngtimeout not found\n/Users/kristinarash/.local/bin/uv\n/opt/homebrew/bin/pwsh\n/Users/kristinarash/.claude/machine.macos.md\n/Users/kristinarash/.claude/TOOLPATHS.md\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/_ARCHIVE/README.md\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/COMMANDS.md\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/FOOTBALL.md\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PERFORMANCE.md\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PERSONAL.md\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PLATFORM.md\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/PROGRAM.md\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/RESEARCH.md\n\n/Users/kristinarash/DEV/_INBOX:\nAgentic Experiment Design & Analysis 2026-06-05 14_08(GMT-5_00).md\nAGENTS.md\nanti-ai-writing-style.md\nbackup_ai_sessions.ps1\nbackup_dev.ps1\nCFBD_API_Access_Verification_2026-08-13.md\nClaude Code Memory Improvements.md\nCLAUDE.md\n      10\n      66\n       5\nls: /Users/kristinarash/.claude/transcripts/.errors.log: No such file or directory","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a3f0cdec-18ab-4a1f-a8a3-d07294770f45","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV","sessionId":"9823c1f0-89f5-4638-9223-c6892607ac2b","version":"2.1.270","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"1992e19d-988b-4938-9853-4586f069cdbe","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a43b3a0aed36748db","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cezy5ejNgHVjYPFGCin21","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LkuXBhkPugUjafdYBZY6MJ","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ~/.claude/projects && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json,glob,os,time,re\nnow=time.time()\nfiles=[f for f in glob.glob('**/*.jsonl',recursive=True) if now-os.path.getmtime(f)<7*86400 and '/subagents/' not in f]\ntot=0;rows=[]\nfor f in files:\n    n=0;first=None;last=None\n    for line in open(f,errors='ignore'):\n        try:d=json.loads(line)\n        except:continue\n        ts=d.get('timestamp')\n        if ts: first=first or ts; last=ts\n        if d.get('type')=='user' and not d.get('isMeta'):\n            c=d.get('message',{}).get('content')\n            if isinstance(c,str): t=c\n            elif isinstance(c,list): t=' '.join(x.get('text','') for x in c if isinstance(x,dict) and x.get('type')=='text')\n            else: t=''\n            if t.strip() and not t.startswith('<') : n+=1\n    tot+=n; rows.append((n,f.split('/')[0][-30:],os.path.basename(f)[:8],(first or '')[:10],(last or '')[:10]))\nrows.sort(reverse=True)\nprint(tot)\nfor r in rows[:45]: print(r)\nEOF","description":"Count user messages per recent transcript"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3553,"cache_read_input_tokens":48616,"output_tokens":1096,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":91},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3553},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":32,"output_tokens":1096,"cache_read_input_tokens":48616,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3553,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_to